      "description": "HRBP for the Research, Design and Development department (previously Global Supply Chain), covering 450+ employees across Singapore, Malaysia, UK, China, Japan, India, USA and more.\n• Partnered with business leaders on strategic HR initiatives; coached line managers on people management.\n• Analysed workforce trends (attrition, engagement, span of control); managed headcount budgets and talent movements.\n• Handled employee relations; led performance evaluations and annual salary review; drove restructuring and culture change.\n• Launched the inaugural Global Supply Chain Graduate Programme (2023) across Singapore, UK, Malaysia and the Philippines - 30 graduates hired in 2023 and 12 in 2024."
