      "description": "Strategic hiring across Singapore and Southeast Asia for research, design, development, operations and quality functions.\n• End-to-end recruitment from sourcing to onboarding; headcount planning with HRBPs; market intelligence and salary benchmarking.\n• Led employer branding initiatives including women-in-engineering events; ran monthly interview training for hiring managers.\n• Closed 110+ key hires, including senior leadership roles across Logistics, Engineering, Procurement and Quality."
